### Create account
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Get account info
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/123
Content-Type: application/json

### Deposit to account
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/123/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Transfer money between accounts
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "123",
  "toAccount": "321",
  "amount": 10,
  "currency": "USD"
}
